[{"s":1795283940,"e":1795285560,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: The Empress","d":"Jotaro and the others next head toward Varanasi  Joseph realizes his arm is quite swollen.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038516_0_20260311T220400644Z_68_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795285560,"e":1795287180,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: Wheel of Fortune","d":"Polnareff drives a car on a very dangerous mountain road toward Pakistan, and recklessly passes a slow moving vehicle that was in front of him.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038516_0_20260311T220400644Z_68_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795287180,"e":1795288740,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: Justice, Part 1","d":"Jotaro and the others successfully survive another attack from the enemy Stand users and make it into Pakistan.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038516_0_20260311T220400644Z_68_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795288740,"e":1795290360,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: Justice, Part 2","d":"Polnareff finally realizes that Enyaba is another assassin from DIO and tries to warn the others, but Enyaba's Stand, Justice, has the ability to take control of people's bodies and corpses, and he gets pursued.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038516_0_20260311T220400644Z_68_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795290360,"e":1795292040,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: The Lovers, Part 1","d":"After surviving Enyaba's attack, Jotaro and crew make it to Pakistan's capital, Karachi, where they encounter DIO's next assassin, Dan