land on the Red Sea and meet Avdol's father.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038596_0_20260311T220400644Z_90_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795300260,"e":1795301820,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: Judgement, Part 2","d":"Polnareff gets attacked by his sister after he revives her using one of the wishes he received.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038596_0_20260311T220400644Z_90_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795301820,"e":1795303440,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: High Priestess, Part 1","d":"Jotaro and the others obtain a submarine to travel through the Red Sea as they head toward Egypt where DIO awaits.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038516_0_20260311T220400644Z_68_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795303440,"e":1795305060,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: High Priestess, Part 2","d":"Jotaro and the others try to escape as the submarine begins sinking from an attack from the enemy Stand, High Priestess.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038516_0_20260311T220400644Z_68_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"},{"s":1795305060,"e":1795306680,"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","st":"Stardust Crusaders: Iggy the Fool and Geb's N'doul, Part 1","d":"Jotaro and the others arrive in Egypt, and are joined by a Boston terrier named Iggy.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2650038516_0_20260311T220400644Z_68_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-584c967455-tswk8.jpeg"}]